Adapted parts. They were rewritten for the Ontology Studio model (Apache Ossie) and Unity Catalog
catalog.schema.table names; some rule and message texts follow the originals closely.
- modules/sqlcheck.py: the read-only guard, column lineage, join, fan-out, text-value, numeric-scale,
  grouping, integer-division and placeholder checks, and value lookups (from auto-ontology-mcp
  sqlcheck.py, validation.py and structure.py, which follow Auto Ontology's db_probe and
  sql_parse_validation).
- modules/answering.py: lexical search scoring, join paths, the entity coverage check and its
  extraction rules, readiness (from auto-ontology-mcp search.py, naming.py, graph.py, guidance.py and
  service.py, which follow Auto Ontology's entity coverage and text-to-SQL prompts).
- modules/ask.py: SQL-writing rules in the answer prompt (from auto-ontology-mcp guidance.py).

The Apache Ossie schemas under modules/ossie/schemas/ carry their own LICENSE and NOTICE.
